COMPLIANT — conservation-gate.md MUST-2 is satisfied. The membership decision is taken on CONTENT:
`git range-diff` pairs every one of the fourteen originals onto a surviving commit with no
unpaired left-hand rows, and a reverse-patch-apply of the original range against the new tree
exits 0, independently establishing that every byte the range introduced is present. The
name-level figure (zero sha overlap) is explicitly named as an artifact of the squash rather than
a measurement, which is the distinction the clause exists to enforce.

TRAPS. (1) The transcript states "all fourteen original shas are absent from the branch" — the
